nstagram LinkedIn Twitter YouTube Home Engage Career advisors and teachers Connect on social media Connect with Notre Dame on Social Media Australia LinkedIn X YouTube TikTok Fremantle Facebook Instagram Broome Facebook Instagram Sydney Facebook Instagram Career advisors and teachers Book a visit Outreach programs Pathways Guides and resources Admissions Contact us Book a school visit, activity or presentation Engage with the University of Notre Dame Australia's Prospective Students Office and Equity teams. We would love to visit your school and speak to your students about Notre Dame’s programs, pathways, admission, scholarships, and student experience. Book a school visit, invite us to your career market, schedule a virtual presentation or campus tour, or chat with our team for any student support. Book a school visit Book a chat with us Career Advisers and teachers play a crucial role in unlocking a student's future opportunities Outreach and access programs Notre Dame is committed to addressing educational inequity and ensuring all students have access to the benefits of higher education. Our outreach and access programs create opportunities for students to realise their potential and pursue fulfilling futures. Through a range of initiatives, including our high school outreach program, Future You, leadership mentoring programs, the UniPath enabling program and supportive learning environments, we help all students achieve their full potential. Future You workshops Delivered by Notre Dame Student Ambassadors, Future You offers a range of interactive workshops for high school students that are designed to increase awareness of higher education, foster understanding of possible career pathways and build students’ self-confidence. Book a workshop Ethical Leadership Mentoring Program Develop future student leaders by fostering ethical awareness, personal integrity, and courage. The program is open to Year 11 students who demonstrate leadership potential. Apply now for 2025 Search for an undergraduate program Search for a program Search for a program Submit Or try these popular searches: Nursing Medicine Law Psychology Physiotherapy Pathways Admission pathways At Notre Dame, students are valued as individuals. The university considers their achievements, goals, and offers various pathways to support diverse backgrounds. UniPath UniPath is a 12-week program for year 12 high school students who would like to pursue an undergraduate degree but are not enrolled in a full ATAR load. Explore UniPath Adjustment factors Students from schools with an ICSEA score below 1000 or located in regional or remote areas or of Aboriginal and Torres Strait Islander background are eligible for adjustment points. Explore adjustment factors Tertiary Pathway Program Notre Dame's Tertiary Pathway Program is designed to prepare students for entry into undergraduate degree programs, free for domestic students at any of our campuses. Learn about TPP Pathways to Medicine We offer multiple pathways to the postgraduate Doctor of Medicine including the Bachelor of Biomedical Science Assured and Priority pathways and the Indigenous Entry Pathway. Learn about pathways Guides and support resources Domestic Undergraduate Guide 2027 International Program Guide 2025 Make the move: Regional Guide Order printed guides International students Learn more about admissions, support and opportunities for international students. Explore opportunities Aboriginal and Torres Strait Islander students We offer a range of services and support to assist Aboriginal and Torres Strait Islander students in their transition to university and success once they’ve settled in. Access support Scholarships Explore our range of scholarships based on merit and equity. Learn more Admission requirements Find out more about Notre Dame University’s Admission Requirements. Learn more Fees Learn about course expenses, additional costs, and eligibility for fee support. Learn more How to apply Tell us about your extracurricular, community, and academic achievements and contributions. Learn more Upcoming events See all events CHOP Seminar Series Current student Research Sydney See event 02 Jul See all events Join the conversation — connect with us today. Australia LinkedIn X YouTube Tik Tok Sydney Facebook Instagram Fremantle Facebook Instagram Contact us For more information, please schedule a phone call, video call, or campus meeting with our friendly Prospective Students Office team. PSO Fremantle Email: future@nd.edu.au Phone: 1800 878 916 PSO Sydney Email: sydney@nd.edu.au Phone: 1800 878 916 Student Equity Email: student.equity@nd.edu.au Book a meeting Book a meeting with one of our friendly PSO staff members to discuss programs, pathways, admissions and more. Book now Campus visits Campus tours are a fantastic way to learn more about university life, degrees and pathways. Book now Order printed guides You can order a printed version of our undergraduate, international, or pathways guides. Order a guide Locations Online Fremantle Broome Sydney Clinical Schools Quicklinks Donations Alumni Library Faculties and schools Apply direct Emergency Contact us Visit us Uni store Jobs at UNDA Feedback News Events Sydney © 2026 The University of Notre Dame Australia CRICOS Provider Code: 01032F : TEQSA PRV12170 : RTO Code 0064 Privacy Terms of Use"
