ing teaching opportunities in the Doctor of Medicine, Graduate Certificate, and Graduate Diploma Sessional Fremantle 30/12/2026 Admissions Coordinator, Admissions Office Coordinate admissions activity that supports a smooth and positive applicant experience. Full-Time Sydney 11/9/2026 Admissions Coordinator, Admissions Office Coordinate admissions activity that supports a smooth and positive applicant experience. Full-Time Fremantle 11/9/2026 VET Program Coordinator, Education Bring your VET leadership expertise to a supportive University community committed to quality, compliance and student success. Full-Time Broome 14/9/2026 National Senior Student Support Officer - VET Join the VET office and drive excellence in VET administration and student support. Full-Time Fremantle 14/9/2026 Trainer and Assessor (Nursing), VET Shape the next generation of healthcare professionals as a Trainer and Assessor (Nursing). Share your expertise, inspire students, and make a real impact. Full-Time Fremantle 14/9/2026 Trainer and Assessor (Nursing), VET Join us in Broome as a Trainer and Assessor (Nursing) mentor future healthcare leaders and make a real difference in the community. Full-Time Broome 14/9/2026 Trainer and Assessor (School Based Education and Support), VET Empower students through Vocational Education and Training (VET) to succeed in education and build skills for life beyond the classroom. Full-Time Broome 14/9/2026 Lecturer (Nursing), School of Nursing and Midwifery Shape the next generation of nurses through innovative, research-led teaching in a supportive, student-focused School of Nursing and Midwifery. Full-Time Fremantle 7/9/2026 1 If there are no roles currently advertised that appear to align with your skillset, we encourage you to register interest with our General Application. Check an existing Application Sign up for Job Alerts Contact Us For further information or enquiries, please contact People and Culture, email employment@nd.edu.au Locations Online F