A Employment opportunities Connect on social media Connect with Notre Dame on Social Media Australia LinkedIn X YouTube Fremantle Facebook Instagram Broome Facebook Instagram Sydney Facebook Instagram Explore our employment opportunities Filter Employment Type full-time general casual sessional Categories education & training casual/ sessional administrative nursing & midwifery eoi Department admissions innovation & design school of arts & sciences school of health sciences school of medicine school of nursing & midwifery vocational education & training Locations australia broome fremantle sydney Position Type/Location Closing Date Type / Location / Closing Date EOI - Academic Sessional (Foundation Years Group Tutor), School of Medicine EOI Academic Sessional Foundation Years Group Tutor Sessional Sydney EOI - Digital Learning and Design Intern Casual roles available for enrolled students who have completed at least one semester of study at The University of Notre Dame Australia. Gain hands-on experience in learning design while working with modern educational General Casual Australia EOI - Academic Sessional (Computer Science), School of Arts and Sciences Passionate about teaching Computer Science? Join Notre Dame as a sessional academic and inspire the next generation. Sessional Australia EOI- Academic Sessional (Occupational Therapy), School of Health Sciences Expression of Interest- Seeking experienced academics with a passion for teaching and expertise in various subject areas for various programs. Teaching opportunities are available on a sessional basis in the Bachelor of Occupational Therapy Sessional Sydney National Deputy Head of School (Nursing & Midwifery) An exciting opportunity to join the University's largest School and one of Australia's premier providers of nursing and midwifery education. Full-Time Sydney 7/9/2026 EOI - Academic Sessional, School of Medicine Expression of Interest - Are you passionate about teaching? The School of Medicine is offering teaching opportunities in the Doctor of Medicine, Graduate Certificate, and Graduate Diploma Sessional Fremantle 30/12/2026 Admissions Coordinator, Admissions Office Coordinate admissions activity that supports a smooth and positive applicant experience. Full-Time Sydney 11/9/2026 Admissions Coordinator, Admissions Office Coordinate admissions activity that supports a smooth and positive applicant experience. Full-Time Fremantle 11/9/2026 VET Program Coordinator, Education Bring your VET leadership expertise to a supportive University community committed to quality, compliance and student success. Full-Time Broome 14/9/2026 National Senior Student Support Officer - VET Join the VET office and drive excellence in VET administration and student support. Full-Time Fremantle 14/9/2026 Trainer and Assessor (Nursing), VET Shape the next generation of healthcare professionals as a Trainer and Assessor (Nursing). Share your expertise, inspire students, and make a real impact. Full-Time Fremantle 14/9/2026 Trainer and Assessor (Nursing), VET Join us in Broome as a Trainer and Assessor (Nursing) mentor future healthcare leaders and make a real difference in the community. Full-Time Broome 14/9/2026 Trainer and Assessor (School Based Education and Support), VET Empower students through Vocational Education and Training (VET) to succeed in education and build skills for life beyond the classroom. Full-Time Broome 14/9/2026 Lecturer (Nursing), School of Nursing and Midwifery Shape the next generation of nurses through innovative, research-led teaching in a supportive, student-focused School of Nursing and Midwifery. Full-Time Fremantle 7/9/2026 1 If there are no roles currently advertised that appear to align with your skillset, we encourage you to register interest with our General Application. Check an existing Application Sign up for Job Alerts Contact Us For further information or enquiries, please contact People and Culture, email employment@nd.edu.au Locations Online F